---
const slots = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6];
---

<section class="defer theme-dark loops py-20 sm:py-28" style="--cis: 945px; --cis-lg: 610px" aria-labelledby="gestos-title">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Así de fácil</p>
      <h2 id="gestos-title" class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Lo que antes costaba minutos, ahora es un gesto
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="reveal flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-night-line bg-night-card">
        <div
          class="split @container grid min-h-56 flex-1 place-items-center bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-8 sm:min-h-64"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Ilustración: una cuenta de 75 € se divide en dos cuentas de 37,50 €."
        >
          <div class="mock relative w-[40%] max-w-56 text-[clamp(10px,3.2cqi,15px)]">
            <div class="split-left mk-paper relative z-10 p-[0.9em] shadow-device">
              <p class="mk-label">Cuenta 1</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[1.6em] font-bold">37,50 €</p>
              <p class="text-[0.8em] text-paper-ink/70">Croquetas · Rabas · Postre</p>
            </div>
            <div class="split-right mk-paper absolute inset-0 p-[0.9em] shadow-device">
              <p class="mk-label">Cuenta 2</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[1.6em] font-bold">37,50 €</p>
              <p class="text-[0.8em] text-paper-ink/70">Txuleta · Txakoli</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Dividir la cuenta</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-mist">Un toque y cada comensal paga lo suyo, a partes iguales o por platos.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-night-line bg-night-card">
        <div
          class="move @container grid min-h-56 flex-1 place-items-center bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-8 sm:min-h-64"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Ilustración: en el plano de la terraza, la mesa 1 se arrastra a un hueco libre y su comanda va con ella."
        >
          <div class="mock w-[70%] max-w-80 text-[clamp(10px,3cqi,15px)]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[0.85em] text-white">
              <span class="font-display font-bold">Plano · Terraza</span>
              <span class="flex gap-[0.8em] text-mist">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-[0.3em]"><i class="size-[0.7em] rounded-full bg-amber"></i>Reservada</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-[0.3em]"><i class="size-[0.7em] rounded-full bg-mint"></i>Ocupada</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="relative mt-[0.7em] grid grid-cols-3 gap-[0.6em] text-white">
              {
                slots.map((n) =>
                  n === 1 || n === 6 ? (
                    <span class="mk-table border-dashed bg-transparent" />
                  ) : (
                    <span class:list={['mk-table', (n === 3 || n === 5) && 'is-busy', n === 4 && 'is-booked']}>{n}</span>
                  ),
                )
              }
              <span class="table-move mk-table is-booked absolute top-0 left-0 w-[calc((100%-1.2em)/3)] shadow-device">
                1<small>37,50 €</small>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Cambiar de mesa</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-mist">Arrastra la mesa en el plano y la comanda viaja con ella.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
